{"id":"663298","name":"蔬菜排骨汤","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/663298/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"木耳","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"海鲜菇","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"木耳提前泡发一下。","img":"images/663298/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"胡萝卜去皮洗净切块。","img":"images/663298/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"海鲜菇清洗干净备用。","img":"images/663298/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"排骨冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净。","img":"images/663298/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"排骨放入高压锅中，加入适量清水。","img":"images/663298/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"大火煮开上汽后压10分钟左右。","img":"images/663298/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"压好的排骨汤煮开。","img":"images/663298/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入胡萝卜。","img":"images/663298/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煲至胡萝卜断生。","img":"images/663298/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入木耳。","img":"images/663298/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"继续煲几分钟左右。","img":"images/663298/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入海鲜菇，煮开至断生后少许盐调味即可。","img":"images/663298/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663298/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663298/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663298/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}